    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe Meadow, the Stream and the Woods in between.\nNestled in a peaceful countryside setting, this charming detached traditional stone cottage offers a rare opportunity to acquire a property of character and tranquility on approximately 2.32 acres /0.94 hectares approx contained in Folio LK1251 and LK71911F.\n\nLocated just 2 km north of Mountcollins Village, with its primary school and local amenities, and just a 10-minute drive from the market town of Abbeyfeale, the property enjoys the perfect balance of rural seclusion and everyday convenience.\n\nSet back from the public road, the cottage offers complete privacy and an idyllic setting surrounded by mature trees and natural beauty. The grounds are a particular feature of the property, several picnic areas both wooded and sunny, attractive birch woodland leading to a stream with towering cedar grove and a unique passageway tunnel from the old mountain road. A picturesque stream runs through the property, while a charming woodland pathway, affectionately known as the \"Fairy Tunnel\", leads to the water's edge, creating a truly magical setting.\n\nThis is a unique opportunity to restore and enjoy a traditional Irish stone cottage in an exceptional natural setting, ideal as a permanent residence, holiday retreat or countryside escape.\n\nThe property has been vacant for over 2 years and would qualify for the Vacant Homes Grant. Full details available from sole selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.57m x 4.19m\nwith solid fuel stove, red brick surround and shelving & 2 windows\n\nKitchen - 2.38m x 2.40m\nwith solid fuel range & 2 windows\n\nBedroom - 4.57m x 3.04\nwith fireplace & window\n\nAttic Room - 4.57m x 2.43m\nwooden flooring & window\n\nBathroom - 2.38m x 1.42m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Charming traditional detached stone cottage and outbuilding full of character and potential</li><li>Standing on approximately 2.32 acres (0.94 ha) contained in Folio LK1251 & LK71911F</li><li>Peaceful rural setting just 2 km north of Mountcollins Village</li><li>Only a 10-minute drive to Abbeyfeale, with a full range of amenities</li><li>Set well back from the public road, offering exceptional privacy and tranquility</li><li>Towering cedar grove and birch evergreen woodland</li><li>The steam has multiple access points on both sides with various picnic areas available</li><li>Traditional stone outbuilding offers excellent renovation potential</ul>"
      },
